        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Grand Canyon",
            "zh": "科罗拉多大峡谷"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Arizona",
            "zh": "亚利桑那州"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", USA is very big. It can be seen from "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It became a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "national park",
            "zh": "国家公园"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 1919. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "canyon",
            "ref": "v-canyon"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is about 446 km long. In some places, it is over 1.8 km deep."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Colorado River",
            "zh": "科罗拉多河"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made the Grand Canyon. Over a long "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "period",
            "zh": "时期"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of time, the river ran over and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wore away",
            "zh": "侵蚀"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "earth",
            "zh": "地面"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". After many years, it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a canyon. And the river "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "continues",
            "ref": "v-continue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to make the Grand Canyon "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " every day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Grand Canyon has many colourful "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "layers",
            "zh": "岩层"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Each layer shows how Earth has changed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the Grand Canyon every year. Some people go to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the canyon. They can see "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "waterfalls",
            "zh": "瀑布"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and colourful "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pools",
            "ref": "v-pool"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " there. Some people take "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to go along the Colorado River. They can enjoy the beautiful "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "views",
            "zh": "景色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " along the river."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is much more to see and do in the national park. It will "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to be protected for many years to come."
          }
        ]
